<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Mixtape Feat Tempo</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Target 45g carbs/hr. Practice this prescription.

WARM-UP:
• 60min Z2 endurance @65% FTP

MAIN SET:
• 3x12min + 1x6min @80% FTP (Z3, tempo/sweet-spot range), with recovery valleys between blocks

COOL-DOWN:
• 5min @50-65% FTP easy spin

EXECUTION:
• Structured Z3 tempo work embedded in a longer Z2 endurance ride — hold steady power through each Z3 block rather than surging.

NUTRITION: 45 g/hr.
HYDRATION: 500-750ml/hr with electrolytes.

DIMENSION: ride the hoods through the tempo blocks -- race position is the fast position. Alternate cadence between blocks: one at 90+, one at 75-80.

RPE guide: 80% FTP -> RPE 5-6; 65% FTP -> RPE 3; 57% FTP -> RPE 3</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <SteadyState Duration="3600" Power="0.65"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="720" Power="0.80" CadenceLow="90" CadenceHigh="90"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.57"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="720" Power="0.80"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.57"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="720" Power="0.80" CadenceLow="90" CadenceHigh="90"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.57"/>
    <SteadyState Duration="360" Power="0.80" CadenceLow="95" CadenceHigh="95"/>
    <Cooldown Duration="300" PowerLow="0.65" PowerHigh="0.50"/>
  </workout>
</workout_file>